Z||000004||Monkeyman||07-22-2001||06:10 PM||||87Pegasus--If it's on the top of the motor, it's the strut tower brace.  If you're referring to the bent bar that runs underneath the car, it's a sway bar (actually it would be an '<I>anti</I>-sway bar).  If it'a sway bar you're looking for, try mounting a used front bar in the back.  Much cheaper than buying another bar.  You can get brand new sway bar sets through the <A HREF="http://www.fierostore.com" TARGET=_blank> Fiero Store.</A><P>------------------<BR>'Consciousness:  That annoying time between naps.'<P>MM||||reg||1
